ABKAA"]],1],null,null,"等待時間",null,"0ahUKEwjhwMfB9dmWAxUOZfUHHdQnCF8Q3IcHCM8BKBA",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["路過發現沒人就進來試試看，整個店裡面只有一位員工，閒到可以滑手機，但備餐的時候也是很專注很用心。\n店內是點餐機自助點餐，有很多貼心的客製化選項，蔥蒜等配料都能調整，另外也有多元支付，非常方便。菜單也按照配料的多寡，從200到超過300的選擇都有。\n個人點了鹽味雞湯，第一口湯，是很鹹香的味道，不是鷹流那種直拳雞湯，雞湯味得細嚐才能感覺到風味，倒也是一種樂趣。\n配料的部分比較特別的是木耳絲，木耳絲是有醃漬過的，醬汁略甜，使得攪拌後的湯頭帶有甜甜的尾韻，更提升一個層次；筍乾則是非常普通；比較意外的是生洋蔥不會嗆辣，而且吃得出非常甜，能夠平衡濃厚的鹽味作為轉韻用。餐桌上的紅胡椒也是想當不錯，香氣非常濃重且特別，偶爾撒一些到湯匙上，能夠換換味道。\n叉燒的部分有炙燒過，香氣十足，只可惜略薄了些，吃起來有點不過癮。\n整體而言是一碗配得上價位的拉麵，單想嚐嚐味道也有基本款的可以選擇，下次應該還會來試試看其他口味。",null,[0,179]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/16034476167396523691/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVDZDFrd09ESmpNMXBtVm5wU1dsWXljekZOTVdkNVZERktObFJ1WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/16034476167396523691/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVDZDFrd09ESmpNMXBtVm5wU1dsWXljekZOTVdkNVZERktObFJ1WXhBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/16034476167396523691/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVDZDFrd09ESmpNMXBtVm5wU1dsWXljekZOTVdkNVZERktObFJ1WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/16034476167396523691/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVDZDFrd09ESmpNMXBtVm5wU1dsWXljekZOTVdkNVZERktObFJ1WXhBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/16034476167396523691/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVDZDFrd09ESmpNMXBtVm5wU1dsWXljekZOTVdkNVZERktObFJ1WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/16034476167396523691/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVDZDFrd09ESmpNMXBtVm5wU1dsWXljekZOTVdkNVZERktObFJ1WXhBQhAA"]],[null,null,10956,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25Cd1kwODJjM1pmVnpSWlYyczFNMWd5VDFKNlRuYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xfae7725481e9119f!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOnBwY082c3ZfVzRZV2s